--- /dev/null
+++ b/common/src/main/resources/assets/mca/skins/clothing/special/README.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+Special outfits: put your own clothing textures here (64x64, same layout as the normal MCA clothes).
+
+  sleepwear/female/*.png   worn by adult female villagers while they sleep
+  sleepwear/male/*.png     worn by adult male villagers while they sleep
+  swimwear/female/*.png    worn by adult female villagers while they are in water
+  swimwear/male/*.png      worn by adult male villagers while they are in water
+
+The same folders also work in a resource pack: assets/<any namespace>/skins/clothing/special/...
+If a folder has several textures, each villager keeps the same one. If a folder is empty, nothing changes.
